{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kittenship Care is a cozy life-sim where you nurture, train, and play with adorable kittens. Create a purr-fect space and keep your furry friends happy in a relaxing, interactive sandbox. No stress\u2014just whiskers, cuddles, and kitten fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/foster_cat_header.png?t=1745187040\" />Take in adorable kittens, care for their needs, and help them find the perfect home. Each kitten has its own personality - bond with them and ensure they're happy and healthy before they move on to a loving family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/CuteCatsezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/make_em_feel_loved_title.png?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pet them, play with them, and shower them with affection! Keep your kittens happy and healthy by giving them all the love and care they deserve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/PettingGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/build_header.png?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a cozy space that feels like home for both you and your kittens! Decorate, rearrange, and make it your own while ensuring your furry friends have everything they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/BuildingGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/help_header.png?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your cats grow and thrive before sending them off to their forever home. Knowing they'll be loved and cared for makes every goodbye a little sweeter.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/Adoptionezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/features_header.png?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adopt &amp; Care for Kittens</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of kittens and tend to their needs in a cozy, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arrange &amp; Decorate Your Space</strong> \u2013 Place furniture and design your space to create the perfect home for your furry friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet Their Needs</strong> \u2013 Keep your kittens happy by providing food, water, and a comfortable place to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand Your Home</strong> \u2013 With each successful adoption, unlock new rooms to build out and customize your ever-growing cozy space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing &amp; Cozy Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a soothing gameplay experience with charming visuals and ambient sounds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597770?t=1745187040","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597770?t=1745187040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/82f6c17cc50b9405bfa347ce0df631612b9f239e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745187040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/82f6c17cc50b9405bfa347ce0df631612b9f239e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745187040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kittenship Care is a cozy life-sim where you nurture, train, and play with adorable kittens. Create a purr-fect space and keep your furry friends happy in a relaxing, interactive sandbox. No stress\u2014just whiskers, cuddles, and kitten fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/foster_cat_header.png?t=1745187040\" />Take in adorable kittens, care for their needs, and help them find the perfect home. Each kitten has its own personality - bond with them and ensure they're happy and healthy before they move on to a loving family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/CuteCatsezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/make_em_feel_loved_title.png?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pet them, play with them, and shower them with affection! Keep your kittens happy and healthy by giving them all the love and care they deserve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/PettingGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/build_header.png?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a cozy space that feels like home for both you and your kittens! Decorate, rearrange, and make it your own while ensuring your furry friends have everything they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/BuildingGif-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/help_header.png?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your cats grow and thrive before sending them off to their forever home. Knowing they'll be loved and cared for makes every goodbye a little sweeter.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/Adoptionezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597770/extras/features_header.png?t=1745187040\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adopt &amp; Care for Kittens</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of kittens and tend to their needs in a cozy, interactive environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arrange &amp; Decorate Your Space</strong> \u2013 Place furniture and design your space to create the perfect home for your furry friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet Their Needs</strong> \u2013 Keep your kittens happy by providing food, water, and a comfortable place to rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand Your Home</strong> \u2013 With each successful adoption, unlock new rooms to build out and customize your ever-growing cozy space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing &amp; Cozy Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a soothing gameplay experience with charming visuals and ambient sounds.</p>","developers":["High Flying Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_